    "title": "Var Olma Stratejileri Üzerine",
    "titleEn": "On Strategies of Existence",
    "subtitle": "Termodinamik, Sağlamlık ve Canlılık",
    "subtitleEn": "Thermodynamics, Durability, and Life",
